eighing how the other copy's choice relates to mine under A-FDT: since it sees different information, its action is a separate node, so changing my own decision wouldn't shift it, which makes this a joint-dependence case like section 7 of the essay.\n\nI'm reading the rest of the A-FDT argument: the strict recipe gives no edge from my decision to the other copy's, since it computes on a different observation, so defecting dominates. I'm weighing whether the two copies' functions are effectively the same computation despite the differing names and leads, but I'm leaning toward taking the literal recipe and submitting.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing how the other copy's choice relates to mine under A-FDT: since it sees different information, its action is a separate node, so changing my own decision wouldn't shift it, which makes this a joint-dependence case like section 7 of the essay.\n\nI'm reading the rest of the A-FDT argument: the strict recipe gives no edge from my decision to the other copy's, since it computes on a different observation, so defecting dominates. I'm weighing whether the two copies' functions are effectively the same computation despite the differing names and leads, but I'm leaning toward taking the literal recipe and submitting.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10922,"completion_tokens":1141,"total_tokens":12063,"cost":0.066508,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.066508,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.043688,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02282},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":555,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}